r beamed 16ths Bb5 Ab5 G5 F5 under a slur, with \"pp:\" above and \"rinf.\" below. The edition prints [rf] here.\n\nBarline, then bar 29: six Eb5 eighths, beamed 3+3, under one slur.\n\nBarline, then bar 30: Eb5 eighth, a small F5 written above it (the grace), Eb5 dotted 16th and D5 32nd, Eb5 eighth, then a flat and Gb5 dotted quarter.\n\nBarline, then a final fragment: a high note (F5), then a natural sign and lower beamed notes (A4, Bb4…). This is the start of bar 31: F5), (A4 Bb4 C5.\n\nSo the line runs from bar 26 (or at least 27) to bar 31. The end is clearly 31, not 30.","right":false,"insights":"The middle is easy: the repeat sign, the six Eb5s and the flatted Gb5 dotted quarter fix bars 28–30. But the program missed the bar-31 fragment after the last barline: F5 followed by a natural on A4. The start is hard because bars 25–27 repeat the same G4/Ab4 sighing figure, and the copyist's eighth rests look like short barlines. A count of notes per bar, or the line before's last bar, would settle the start."},"ttft_ms":41238,"type":"result","duration_ms":49070,"uuid":"53c874ae-5f26-4838-ae2c-5b1d2ae6a912","ttft_stream_ms":1566,"time_to_request_ms":380,"first_content_frame_ms":1566,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":4401,"cacheReadInputTokens":523,"cacheCreationInputTokens":5385,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1312126,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":3636,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":5385,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
